  "recipe": {
    "what": "How a workspace package of this candidate is built. Every step after the first needs the game's own master, the Papyrus compiler and the reviewed compiled scripts of the Details runtime, on a licensed PC; none of them has been run for this candidate. tools/win/Build-Greenwater.ps1 does steps 2, 3, 5 and 6 and writes a measurement; it is untested scaffolding, never run and never parsed by PowerShell. Nothing is installed, and no licensed file goes into the repository or the cloud.",
    "steps": [
      "1. python3 tools/greenwater_story_candidate.py verify   (the checkout is this manifest's source)",
      "2. dotnet run --project tools/PluginBuilder -- --out <new folder>/plugin --fallout4-esm <Fallout4.esm>   (self-check must pass; READ THE REPORT: every 'not wired' line, and what the builder found for Charisma, for the meal and for the six people's originals)",
      "3. dotnet run --project tools/WorldSliceBuilder -- <Fallout4.esm> <new folder>/world --story-source <new folder>/plugin/TheLastMeridian.esp --natural --private-shelter-detail   (the same exterior options as the Details package; it refuses a clone whose first section does not point at TLM_GW, or whose greybox is not the 31 pieces)",
      "4. COMPILE PROOF: compile all 23 scripts under scripts/Source/User/TLM afresh with the game's Papyrus compiler into a folder of its own (tools/win/Build-Scripts.ps1 compiles every .psc there). All 23 must compile. Keep the compiler's log and the 23 results with the build receipt.",
      "5. THE REVIEWED 17: take the compiled scripts of the Details runtime (the 19 that tools/win/world-details-artifact.json pins under 'runtime'). For each of the 17 names under runtimeSelection.reusedReviewedPex, check the file's SHA-256 against the digest recorded there before using it. Step 1 has already shown that their 17 sources are the reviewed text.",
      "6. THE BUNDLE'S Scripts/TLM: exactly 23 files. The 17 reviewed files of step 5, copied byte for byte; the 6 under runtimeSelection.freshlyCompiled from the compile of step 4. Never the freshly compiled 17, whether or not the compiler happened to reproduce them, and never an earlier Act1Walk.pex, Act1Guide.pex or MercyBriefing.pex.",
      "7. python3 tools/greenwater_story_candidate.py measure <bundle folder> --fresh-compile <folder of step 4>   (prints the measured digests for the build receipt and says of each script whether it is the reviewed file or one of the six fresh ones; exit 1 if the selection is not the one above; it changes no pin)"
    ],
    "packager": "tools/win/Build-Greenwater.ps1 -VanillaMaster <Fallout4.esm> -ReviewedRuntime <folder> -FreshCompile <folder of step 4> -OutputDirectory build\\<new folder>",
